# Pre-flight (#1970)
`.cursor/hooks/preflight.js` runs each turn: answers short scripted asks, writes a handoff past half-context, and after the first tool call returns a pack (size, rules, likely files, related tickets, open PRs/worktrees on those files). Read named rules/files before wider search. If "Open work on the same files" lists a PR or worktree on what you will change, build on it or tell Carlos—don't rewrite in parallel (#2969). Draft plan is a starting point; rules here win. Automations: `node .cursor/hooks/preflight.js plan "<prompt>"` first. Token habits / plan-% / model strategy: `token-habits.mdc`.
